{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And you saw their detestable things.</b> So called because they are abhorrent like detestable things." "<b>Their dung.</b> Because they are foul and abhorrent like dung." "<b>Wood and stone.</b> Those of wood and of stone you saw in the open, because the gentile is not afraid lest they be stolen; but those of silver and gold <b>with them</b> — they are in the inner chambers of their shrines, because they are afraid lest they be stolen (Tanchuma)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:48:49.820676643Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}